<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Dec 24.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Dec 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein - No trade reported.</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jan 99.50.</p>
<p>Avonmouth Jan 98.50.</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Jan/Mar 100.00 Apr/Jun 102.50.</p>
